OL,3,GNEWSAClimate emergency declaration
OL,4,Ascrapped by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalderdale Council has voted to scrap
OL,7,Fits climate emergency declaration
OL,8,Fseveral years after it was introduced.
OL,10,FThe decision was made by the Reform
OL,11,FUK-led administration, despite its
OL,12,Fleader Dan Sutherland having proposed
OL,13,Fthe original declaration when he was a
OL,14,FLabour councillor in 2019, saying
OL,15,Fimmediate action was needed.
OL,17,FProtesters gathered outside Halifax
OL,18,FTown Hall before Wednesday's meeting,
OL,19,Fwith two members of the public removed
OL,20,Ffrom the gallery during the debate.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
