OL,3,GNEWSAClimate emergency declaration
OL,4,Ascrapped by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform councillor Connor Dent told the
OL,7,Fmeeting scrapping the declaration was
OL,8,Fnot because "we should care less about
OL,9,Four environment", but questioned
OL,10,Fwhether it gave "the best possible
OL,11,Foutcomes" for residents and the
OL,12,Fenvironment.
